OL,3,AThe little Welsh town that transformed 
OL,4,Aa Strictly star's career               
OL,6,FWilliams, from Bury in Greater         
OL,7,FManchester, feels so connected to the  
OL,8,Ftown that he insisted on having a show 
OL,9,Fat the Theatr Clwyd on his upcoming    
OL,10,Ftour, Layton Live.                     
